[17:38.45]Do I sound stupid? 
[17:40.05]Am I wearing unattractive clothes?
[17:42.29]It is obvious that such uncomfortable feelings must affect people unfavorably. 
[17:47.91]A person's self-concept is reflected in the way he or she behaves, and the way a person behaves affects other people's reactions. 
[17:56.75]In general, the way people think about themselves has a deep effect on all areas of their lives.
[18:03.45]Shy people, having low self-esteem, are likely to be passive and easily influenced by others. 
