[18:32.18]I know it's not true.¡±
[18:34.20]Can shyness be completely got rid of or at least reduced fortunately? 
[18:39.66]People can overcome shyness with patient effort in building self-confidence. 
[18:45.26]Since shyness goes hand in hand with lack of self-esteem, it is important for people to accept their weaknesses as well as their strengths. 
